This mod also contains a variation "small" that looks like the biscuit one, but without the furnaces. 
Currently, it is not used. But maybe someone makes a mod that produces toasters etc. in assembly lines, so I thought its better to make more than enough variations...
Also, there's a rda file for the base factory, but without the furnaces on the side. It's a little bit bugged because it also deletes the fence around the factory, but if you're fine with that...
To use the smaller models for a different factory, you'll also have to edit  the .fc file (otherwise) you'll have some pigeons and people floating around.
The roof of the medium variation has been moved down by 0.92158 units.
The roof of the small variation has been moved down by 2.30198 units.